{"id":"vod_sn_60728","vodId":"60728","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"战国妖狐救世姐弟篇","name_cn":"战国妖狐救世姐弟篇","date":"2024-01-01","year":"2024","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全13集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20240110-1/6b20eaec8efa638fe67ed6dcca679713.jpg"},"summary":"时间为战国时代，世上所具有的各种魑魅魍魉、异形妖怪等非人灵力生物总称为”暗“。喜欢人类的暗——妖狐玉，以及厌恶人类的仙道——迅火，成立了名为“救世姐弟”的组合进行著扫荡罪恶的救世活动，途中遇上了武士兵头真介。另外还有一群专门对付暗的僧侣·断怪众，他们为了消灭对人类作恶的暗“障怪”的以不人道的方式进行人体改造，迅火等人与他们产生激烈冲突！人类当中也有坏人，非人类的存在也不见得都是邪恶的，迅火因过去的事而极其讨厌人类，但在旅程当中，也逐渐目睹到人类善良的一面，他是否能有所转变呢。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-04-03 23:51:31","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202401/10/r10yfUFz812/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202401/17/6QLaxCFAeD2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202401/24/ERbCDdHxUS2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202402/01/6ja1QAYcJp2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v3.rstu6.com/202402/08/UYyG7ZW2fc2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v12.rstu6.com/202402/14/RwuMhradcR4/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v2.rstu6.com/202402/22/ipu1B1TFds2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v2.rstu6.com/202402/28/rTRGgDCPDr2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v2.rstu6.com/202403/07/3ejjKmB4KJ2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v11.rstu6.com/202403/13/Q2CEpVbXtH3/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v11.rstu6.com/202403/20/3uNQ8JutTV3/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v11.rstu6.com/202403/28/0ChZHBwBGK3/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v11.rstu6.com/202404/03/EfA8RZbAC73/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:45.211Z"}